  "title": "Top stores by Q3 net sales",
  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "3a570714-bb32-4263-baba-dad8ed56a6d5",
      "question": "Which five physical stores (excluding the online store) had the highest net sales in Q3 2026, July 1 to September 30?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-03T04:14:14.056463Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-03T04:14:20.123527Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Top 5 physical stores by net sales in Q3 2026 (July 1 – September 30)**\n\n| Rank | Store ID | Store Name | Region | Store Type | Net Sales (USD) |\n|------|----------|------------|--------|------------|-----------------|\n| 1 | S21 | Lumen San Francisco Union Square | West | flagship | 19,982.26 |\n| 2 | S13 | Lumen Chicago Loop | Midwest | flagship | 15,651.28 |\n| 3 | S07 | Lumen Atlanta Midtown | Southeast | flagship | 12,373.93 |\n| 4 | S06 | Lumen Newark Gateway | Northeast | standalone | 10,910.95 |\n| 5 | S01 | Lumen Boston Seaport | Northeast | flagship | 8,412.91 |\n\n[1]\n\nAll four flagships (San Francisco, Chicago, Atlanta, Boston) and one standalone store (Newark) make the top five. The online store (WEB) was excluded as requested.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Structured retrieval result — retail_sales — evidence `hermes-receipt:dc429486de3d68d6dd9a29525e6eb1c9459aaaf34eca39098ad23a8453a87ce3`",
